  "risk_details": "Leaving **public network access** enabled exposes the storage account endpoints to the **public Internet**, widening the attack surface and undermining **defense in depth**.\n\nThis increases the risk of **unauthorized access**, **data exfiltration**, and reconnaissance against the account, especially when combined with weak network rules or overly permissive access policies.",
